  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L3-53 Agro-Food Industrie entrepen&#xf6;rst&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">L3-53 Agro-Food Industrie entrepreneurial support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektets m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att utveckla, producera och marknadsf&#xf6;ra prisv&#xe4;rda mat f&#xf6;r sp&#xe4;dbarn (6-24months). Projektet omfattar ink&#xf6;p av r&#xe5;varor, desig och upps&#xe4;ttande av produktion, g&#xf6;ra aff&#xe4;rsplaner etc. Projektet arbetar i n&#xe4;ra samarbete med GAIN (Globala alliansen f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;b&#xe4;ttrad nutrition). Avtalspart &#xe4;r AGRO-FOOD INDUSTRIE, org.nr AGRO FOOD INDUSTRI, Marocko.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will develop, produce and market affordable Infant cereals to prevent malnutrition in Infant and Young children (6-24months). The project includes sourcing of raw materials,  desigining and purchasning the full processing line, defining business plans etc. The project works in close collaboration with GAIN (Global Alliance for improved Nutrition. Agreement partner is AGRO-FOOD INDUSTRIE, org reg no AGRO FOOD INDUSTRIE, Morocco.</narrative>
  </description>
